<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 788―exactly 12 years ago today, a hanami visitor died in an accident in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fell from a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Got drunk and went tree climbing or something, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who died was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki-cho resident <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="えいいちろう">Eiichiro</STYLE> Niimura-san (30)<PG>
Niimura...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura, as in...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Right, having come this far, there's only one thing I can do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that's to ask <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> is this Niimura-san's daughter, I can't rule out the possibility that she's involved in this morning's incident, either.<PG>
...No, I'd better not call after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I do ask, it should be after I've gathered more solid information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, there's no need to rush.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is at the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She should be safe.<PG>
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
But right next door to <STYLE ID="3">Senpai's</STYLE> house is <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is involved in the incident, I absolutely must not let her get close.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! I'm scared! Right now, by myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Heh, really, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. You really are my cute junior. Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, come over to my place. That way we can be together, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"All right. I'm sorry, please let me do that."</STYLE><PG>
In that case, I'll be her bodyguard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I may not be much to rely on, but if I stay on guard at all times, I can manage somehow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I stay awake and keep watch, we'll surely make it to morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just in case, I'll bring anything that could work as a weapon.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
A hammer... a kitchen knife... a frying pan...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A box cutter, plus... a small saw... a wrench...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "100"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神遠い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "300" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... let's run, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... it's... no use..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神突進.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "111" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2,111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
